#: applications/luci-app-lldpd/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/lldpd/config.js:678
msgid ""
"Allows an agent to control the propagation of LLDPDUs. By default, the MAC "
"address %s is used and limits the propagation of the LLDPDU to the nearest "
"bridge."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເອເຈນຄວບຄຸມການແຜ່ກະຈາຍຂອງ LLDPDU. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC %s "
"ເຊິ່ງຈຳກັດການແຜ່ກະຈາຍຂອງ LLDPDU ໄວ້ພຽງແຕ່ບຣິດທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດ."

